WEBVTT

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.120
<i>This isn't too weird, is it?</i>

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:26.770
I hope my young master notices me.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:03.510
<b>Episode 4: Does the Young Master Like Pudding?</b>

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:13.700
<i>How did it come to this?</i>

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>I want the young master to grow up healthy 
and well, both physically and emotionally.</i>

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.860
<i>That's why I came to this mansion.</i>

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:27.550
Would you be so kind as 
to hire me at this mansion?

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:31.140
<i>It was, but...</i>

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.960
<i>He's so suspicious of me.</i>

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.090
<i>I can't blame him.</i>

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.660
<i>I did just barge in on him.</i>

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:45.520
<i>But at this rate, I'm going to 
have a negative influence on him.</i>

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:52.370
<i>For him to grow up healthy, 
I need to get closer to him.</i>

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:59.790
<i>Watching over the young master is 
my duty as a maid and a grown-up.</i>

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.340
What have you been doing 
all this time, Lilith?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.730
Y-Young master...

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.160
Why are you monitoring me?

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.140
Um...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.290
I'm...

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.430
You're always watching me, too, though.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.380
You're looking for my 
weaknesses, aren't you?!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:31.960
I won't let you!

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.610
Young master, wait!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:37.810
Lilith!

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:46.280
Ow...

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.540
I'm sorry, young master!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:50.500
Are you all right?

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.680
I need to watch over you, don't I?

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.190
I won't run away, and I won't let you go.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.180
Right.

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:13.770
<i>I'm trying to get closer to him,</i>

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.890
<i>but I just landed on top of him instead.</i>

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:23.150
<i>Look at that frown...</i>

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.120
<i>I have to redeem myself,</i>

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.500
<i>by being more grown-up and maid-like.</i>

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.000
Young master...

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:44.810
Don't you get bored watching me so much?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.320
<i>That came across as grown-up, didn't it?</i>

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.540
Suspicious!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.680
You're trying to divert my attention so you 
can get away with your insidious plots!

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:58.070
I-I'm not...

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.810
<i>H-Here we go...</i>

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:05.410
You're beautiful when you're 
working, too, you know.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:09.520
No matter where I look from, no matter 
what you're doing, I won't get bored.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.120
I could watch you for hours and hours!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.410
<i>J-Just like I thought...</i>

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.490
I wish I could watch you my whole life!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.280
That's good, then.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.260
<i>It's not good!</i>

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.320
<i>I can't.</i>

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:34.000
<i>He's so honest, I can't behave 
like a well-composed adult.</i>

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:37.900
<i>Next time...</i>

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:49.130
<i>First, I need to get his guard down.</i>

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.230
<i>For that...</i>

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:54.170
<i>I'm going to demonstrate that I'm 
a dependable, grown-up maid.</i>

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.440
Young master...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:03.580
I know all about your feelings.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:09.830
Suspicious!

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:11.540
Huh?!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:15.880
<i>I was just trying to tell 
him that I understand him.</i>

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:17.640
Wait...

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:20.640
You know that I want to 
get to know you better...

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.860
That you're all I ever think about...

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.780
You see through all of that?!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.850
<i>This wasn't the plan!</i>

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.780
I'm right, aren't I?

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.380
You're definitely suspicious.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.590
<i>I blew it again!</i>

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:50.310
<i>I just want to get closer 
to the young master,</i>

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.710
<i>yet I'm getting nowhere.</i>

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:58.410
<i>It's not that he hates me, I'm sure...</i>

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:03.550
<i>But he's never going to 
trust me if this keeps up.</i>

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.100
<i>There has to be a way.</i>

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:13.850
<i>A way to gain his trust 
and become closer to him.</i>

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:18.450
Play?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.440
Yes.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:22.070
We may as well, since we're 
both here in the mansion.

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.330
How about a change of pace?

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:29.060
<i>Play is surely the best way 
to relate to each other.</i>

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.430
Sure.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:35.560
We'll have lots of fun, just the two of us.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:39.480
<i>Well?</i>

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.070
<i>That was a good, grown-up 
invitation, wasn't it?</i>

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.640
More fun than now?

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.450
But I'm already having plenty 
of fun since you came.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.480
I'm having fun whenever you're around.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.450
Wait...

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.280
Is this part of your trap, too?

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.800
<i>Why...</i>

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:05.070
You're enjoying making 
me suspicious of you...

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.930
Wait, huh?

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:07.920
Young master...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.260
<i>He's confused himself with his own words.</i>

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.060
What does that mean?!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.590
<i>That's my line!</i>

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:17.950
I-I'm sure we'll understand 
if we play together.

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:20.510
Let's play your favorite game.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.000
Really?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.210
In that case...

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.080
It's your turn.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.100
Right.

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:36.410
Young master?

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:41.660
This is the one game my father taught me.

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:47.470
My mother and father were very kind people,

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.270
but they were always busy.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.190
They were rarely home.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:53.950
So...

00:08:55.950 --> 00:09:00.130
I was happy whenever they were here.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:06.520
Nope.

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:07.690
No!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.950
I want to play with Father!

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:16.440
Yuuri, Dad's at home today, 
but he has to work.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.070
I know.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.440
Why don't you play with me today?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:30.120
We can make the pudding that 
you and your dad both like.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:30.880
Okay?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.080
Father said you don't know how to cook.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:39.750
Fine!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.580
I'll make the very best pudding 
and make him admit that it's delicious!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:52.720
Listen, you must not distract 
Father, all right?

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:10.600
Yuuri.

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:23.570
I hope Yuuri's being a good boy.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:25.400
King.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.320
King.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.500
Knight.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.540
Knight.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:29.370
Pawn.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.290
Bawn.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:35.110
Yuuri, it's "pawn," not "bawn."

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.240
Pawn.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.180
That's right. Good job.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.710
You're the king, Father.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.440
That would make Mother the queen.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:49.550
By the way, the queen is the 
strongest piece in all of chess.

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.530
Stronger than the king?

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.550
That's right, stronger than the king.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:58.250
So Mother's the strongest 
in the family, then?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.790
I suppose so.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:02.370
Yuuri.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.890
I knew you'd be in here.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:11.880
But I want to play with Father.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:13.930
I'm sorry.

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:15.890
Come on, Shiho.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:18.160
Yuuri says he's sorry.

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.190
And you, honey.

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:22.410
You always spoil Yuuri.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.070
I'm sorry.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.750
Just this once.

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:38.420
Mother, Father taught me chess.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:42.130
He says you're the queen.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.470
We were just saying you're 
beautiful, like a queen.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.310
Aw, you're embarrassing me.

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.550
Anyway, was there something you wanted?

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.900
Right.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.290
I made some pudding.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:11:59.820
Why don't you both come for tea?

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:06.440
I'm hungry!

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:18.290
I only played chess with 
my father a few times,

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:21.680
but it was fun.

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:29.930
Young master, I'm here.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:33.180
I'll play you whenever 
you'd like from now on.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.560
Lilith...

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:50.800
I'm good at this, you know.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.370
Watch me beat you, Lilith.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:55.960
Not without a fight, Master Yuuri.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:13:00.910
<i>Maybe I was getting too anxious.</i>

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:06.070
<i>I'll just do what I can, little by little,</i>

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:10.840
<i>so that the young master will smile more.</i>

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:24.310
Young master, I did say we should 
have fun, but... it's getting...

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.360
One more!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.920
We're playing one more game!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.650
Bye-bye.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:33.580
Bye.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.210
<i>Maybe I'll make pudding today.</i>

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:54.560
<i>I'm sure the young master 
will enjoy it, too.</i>

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:01.140
Welcome home, young master.

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:03.480
Thanks.

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:06.750
Young master?

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.620
It turned out quite well.

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:25.160
<i>The young master appeared a bit down 
earlier, but hopefully this pudding...</i>

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.040
It's suspicious that you'd 
suddenly serve pudding!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.810
What are you scheming?!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:33.770
I thought you might want some pudding.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.020
What are you, Lilith? A psychic?

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.770
How could you know what I wanted?

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.700
Delicious!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.430
There's more, if you'd like.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.220
<i>No doubt about it.</i>

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.370
Yeah?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:52.200
I made pudding for snack time.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.400
Would you like some?

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.820
It's hand-made.

00:14:57.820 --> 00:14:59.710
Thanks.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:09.130
<i>The young master isn't suspicious of me?!</i>

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:12.800
<i>It's a good thing that he 
isn't suspicious of me.</i>

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:16.280
<i>This is the way it ought to be 
between a maid and her master.</i>

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:20.010
<i>The young master can grow up healthy now...</i>

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.830
<i>But...</i>

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.860
<i>I still want him to be suspicious of me!</i>

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:30.910
You're suspicious, following me around!

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:33.180
<i>This should do it.</i>

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:40.210
<i>He didn't notice me!</i>

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.590
<i>He's always so alert.</i>

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:44.900
<i>What's going on?!</i>

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:48.580
<i>Is he ignoring me, knowing I'm here?</i>

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:52.920
<i>Or has he lost interest in me?</i>

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:56.550
Lilith...

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.830
Um...

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:01.510
Here...

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.390
<i>A dismissal notice!</i>

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.820
Open House Day

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.580
Open house day?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:17.610
M-My teacher said that servants 
often attend it at our school.

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.790
And you're all I have.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:26.040
But you're suspicious, 
and you'll attract attention.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.710
I don't want other people to meet you.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:36.140
So I've been trying to decide what to do, 
but the open house is tomorrow...

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:37.870
So...

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.570
I'm not forcing you, but...

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:45.890
I hope you come.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.370
Gladly.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.250
I'll take care of it.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:56.950
You'll come?!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.130
Of course.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:01.140
I'm glad to hear it.

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:04.840
I thought you'd lost interest in me.

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:06.840
Of course not!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:11.460
I've been thinking this whole time 
about how I could get you to come!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.820
You're all I ever think about!

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.330
M-Me, too.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.720
Did you say something?

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:25.810
<b>Smile</b>

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:25.810
<b>Oh, my</b>

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:25.810
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.820
<i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious.</i>

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.560
Listen up, Lilith.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:40.450
Both the teachers and the parents at 
the school I go to are very strict.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.790
You know what I'm trying to tell you, right?

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:47.610
You want me to be more strict with you.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:48.890
That's not it at all!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.390
It's your outfit!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.770
This is my normal maid outfit.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:56.700
It's not normal.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.980
Understood.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.670
I'll dress up as fancy as I can.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.160
That's no better!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:05.840
You'll make not just me, but my 
whole class obsessed with you!

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.380
It'll collapse the school!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:09.970
Don't you think that's a 
bit of an overstatement?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:14.610
In any case, please come to the 
open house in normal clothing.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.860
<i>This one's too dull.</i>

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.400
<i>The back is too exposed on this one.</i>

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:31.170
<i>This one might get me 
scolded by the young master.</i>

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:34.810
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:44.380
<i>I hope Lilith isn't going to miss it because 
she doesn't have any other clothes.</i>

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:50.990
<i>I was just glad I was able to tell 
her there was an open house.</i>

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.150
Sorry.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:03.240
Mom and I have some very important 
work that we have to attend to.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.780
Do good, Yuuri.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.520
It's just my mom coming.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:26.400
Both of my parents are coming.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.350
Everyone, take your seats, please.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:34.810
Class is starting.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.810
Parents and guardians, please enter.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.170
<i>She doesn't have to come.</i>

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:51.430
<i>I'm fine on my own.</i>

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.530
<i>She's too suspicious.</i>

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.880
<i>So why was I hoping she'd come?</i>

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.160
My apologies.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:21.440
You were the only one I could ask.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.530
Thank you, Fujisaki-san.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:27.960
It's not a big deal at all.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:41.140
I apologize for arriving late today.

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:43.900
It took longer to prepare than I expected.

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:45.310
Yeah.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.850
You were working hard today.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:50.760
Yeah.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.730
Why won't you look at me?

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.400
Young master?

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:05.450
Thanks for coming today.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.770
You made me happy.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.420
Thank you, too.

00:22:56.710 --> 00:22:59.220
School was more exhausting than usual.

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:02.790
Lilith.

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:04.910
There's something I forgot to tell you.

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:06.720
What is it, young master?

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:09.230
You looked good in that outfit, too.

00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:16.600
What am I to do with you, young master?

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:23.990
<b>Next Time
Episode 5: My Precious...</b>
